<main id="main" class="collection-page"><section class="section light event-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">EVENTS & APPEARANCES</span><h1>Ideas worth<br/>talking about.</h1><p>Conversations about digital humans, AI and the ways we connect with technology. Keynotes, panels and interviews from David’s work around the world.</p><a class="button" href="/combined-direction/contact/">Invite David to speak <Icon name="mail" size={17}/></a></div><img src="/images/events-17.webp" alt="David Bennett at the AI for Developing Countries Forum" width="1000" height="800"/></section><section class="section dark"><span class="eyebrow">LATEST FROM THE STAGE</span><h2>Accelerate Tomorrow<br/>AI Summit 2026.</h2><p>2–3 June 2026 · Estrel Berlin · Speaker</p><p>David joined the summit to discuss AI, digital humans and enterprise innovation.</p><a class="button" href="https://www.davidaaronbennett.com/post/david-bennett-accelerate-tomorrow-ai-summit-2026">Read the event story <Icon/></a></section><section class="section light"><div class="collection-heading"><span class="eyebrow">ON STAGE. IN CONVERSATION.</span><h2>Events & featured articles.</h2></div><div class="event-directory">{entries.map(event=><article><a href={event.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src={event.image} alt={event.title} width="900" height="650" loading="lazy"/></a><div><h3>{event.title}</h3><p>{event.description}</p><a class="text-button" href={event.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View appearance <Icon size={16}/></a></div></article>)}</div></section></main><footer class="footer dark"><div class="footer-top"><a class="identity" href="/combined-direction/"><span>DAVID BENNETT<small>FOUNDER · FUTURIST · SPEAKER</small></span></a><nav aria-label="Social profiles"><a href={linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="David on LinkedIn"><Icon name="linkedin" size={18}/></a><a href={imdb} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IMDb</a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/davidaaronbennett/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a><a href={email} aria-label="Email David"><Icon name="mail" size={18}/></a></nav><a href="/combined-direction/about/">About</a><a href="/combined-direction/contact/">Contact</a><a href="/combined-direction/" class="back-top">BACK TO TOP <Icon size={15}/></a></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} David Bennett</span><span>Mimic Productions <b>·</b> Mimic Minds</span><a href={email}>dbennett@mimicproductions.com</a></div></footer></div><script>const b=document.querySelector('.menu-toggle');const n=document.querySelector('#navigation');b?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const o=b.getAttribute('aria-expanded')!=='true';b.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(o));n?.classList.toggle('open',o)});</script></body></html>